**Build and modify the actual project files. Do not merely produce recommendations, a plan, pseudocode, a mockup, or code snippets.**

Work autonomously. Do not ask clarifying questions. Make conservative decisions based on the project specifications and document important decisions and any unresolved limitations.

Your objective is a polished, functional, secure, maintainable, offline-capable personal life dashboard that people can run by downloading a ZIP, extracting it, and double-clicking `index.html`.

